    "title": "Carpet Motifs and Symbolism: What the Medallions, Vines, Boteh and Trees of Life Really Mean",
    "metaDescription": "Decode the language of carpet design: medallions, boteh, tree of life, garden layouts, lattices, borders and more, with their origins, symbolism and how designers use them today.",
