    "category": "Rug Care",
    "readTime": "8 min",
    "wordCount": 1020,
    "publishedAt": "2026-12-15",
    "faq": [
      {
        "q": "Why should you never wrap stored rugs in plastic?",
        "a": "Plastic wraps trap ambient moisture and condensation, leading to irreversible mildew, dry rot of cotton warps, and fiber degradation."
      },
      {
        "q": "What actually eats wool rugs?",
        "a": "Adult moths do not eat wool; their microscopic larvae feed on organic keratin, particularly where organic dirt, sweat, or food spills are present."
      },
      {
        "q": "How should a rug be rolled for storage?",
        "a": "Always roll the rug pile-inward around a rigid cardboard or PVC cylinder. Never fold a pile rug, as folding fractures structural foundations."
      }
    ],
    "content": "<p>Wool is a resilient natural protein fiber, but improper seasonal storage or neglecting dark corners under furniture can invite clothes moths (<em>Tineola bisselliella</em>) and carpet beetles. Protecting your investment requires basic preventative habits.</p>\n<h2>The 4 Golden Rules of Long-Term Rug Storage</h2>\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>Deep Clean Before Rolling:</strong> Never store a dirty rug. Moths target areas containing microscopic protein traces from food crumbs, pet dander, and foot oils. Thoroughly vacuum both face and back.</li>\n  <li><strong>Roll, Never Fold:</strong> Folding creates permanent foundation creases and can snap warp threads under pressure. Roll pile-inward around a supportive core.</li>\n  <li><strong>Wrap in Breathable Materials:</strong> Avoid clear plastic trash bags. Use breathable Tyvek wrap or heavy-duty brown kraft paper that allows air circulation while blocking insect entry.</li>\n  <li><strong>Elevate Off Concrete Floors:</strong> Store rolled carpets horizontally on shelving or pallets in climate-controlled spaces, well away from damp basement masonry.</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"blog-cta\"><p><strong>Looking for handmade rugs from Bhadohi, India?</strong> Tajmahal Products is a sixth-generation, family-owned manufacturer and exporter of handmade carpets and rugs, established 1967. For custom and private-label enquiries, email <a href=\"mailto:tmproducts.bhadohi@gmail.com\">tmproducts.bhadohi@gmail.com</a> or call +91 82995 01435.</p></div>",
