    "readTime": "8 min",
    "wordCount": 1090,
    "publishedAt": "2026-12-30",
    "faq": [
      {
        "q": "Why do freshly woven rugs need intensive washing?",
        "a": "Washing flushes out shearing dust, loose surface fiber remnants, and fixes colorfastness while aligning the pile in its natural direction."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is an 'antique stone wash'?",
        "a": "An antique wash uses natural enzymatic solutions and gentle pumice paddles to soften high-contrast tones, giving new rugs the mellowed patina of historic heirlooms."
      },
      {
        "q": "How are rugs dried after washing?",
        "a": "Rugs are blocked (stretched square on wooden frames) and dried under natural Bhadohi sunshine to naturally sanitize and set wool fibers."
      }
    ],
    "content": "<p>When a hand-knotted carpet is cut from the loom beams after months of knotting, it looks stiff, dusty, and unrefined. The miraculous transformation from raw woven textile to supple, lustrous floor art occurs during post-loom washing and finishing.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: The High-Pressure Scour & Squeegee</h2>\n<p>The carpet is saturated with fresh water and treated with mild coconut-oil soaps. Teams of skilled finishers pass heavy wooden squeegees (<em>lagadas</em>) across the pile, expelling excess dye particles and fiber dust trapped between knots.</p>\n<h2>Step 2: Specialized Herbal & Luster Baths</h2>\n<p>Depending on the required aesthetic, carpets receive specialized finishing treatments: herbal baths for organic tactile softness, mild luster rinses to enhance light refraction, or vintage stone washes for an authentic muted appearance.</p>\n<h2>Step 3: Solar Drying & Orthogonal Blocking</h2>\n<p>The wet carpet is mounted on heavy iron or timber tension frames to ensure perfectly straight borders (blocking), then cured under the bright North Indian sun.</p>\n<div class=\"blog-cta\"><p><strong>Looking for handmade rugs from Bhadohi, India?</strong> Tajmahal Products is a sixth-generation, family-owned manufacturer and exporter of handmade carpets and rugs, established 1967. For custom and private-label enquiries, email <a href=\"mailto:tmproducts.bhadohi@gmail.com\">tmproducts.bhadohi@gmail.com</a> or call +91 82995 01435.</p></div>",
